><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">지난 6일 수련시설들과 상호 협력을 위한 실무협의회를 가진바 있는 강화군시설관리공단은 현장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">고객의 다양한 의견을 청취하고 공단이 관리하는 주요 관광시설을 안내하는 수련시설의</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"> 임ㆍ직원들이 홍보위</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">으로서 적합하다고 판단, 공단 홍보위원으로 위촉하게 됐다고 밝혔다.</span> </p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">이번에 위촉된 홍보위원들은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">강화군시설관리공단이 관리하고 있는 관광시설 등에 대하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">대내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">외에 적극적인 홍보를 함으로써 관광객 증대를 통한 지역경제활성화에 기여할 것으로 전망된다. </span></p> <p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">▲ 홍보위원 명단</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">강화남산 유스호스텔&nbsp;&nbsp; 전영수 전무이사</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">강화 유스호스텔&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정훈달 사장</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">계명 수련원&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 조대현 법인사무국장</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">마니산 청소년수련원&nbsp;&nbsp; 윤미남 과장</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">서해 유스호스텔&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 한관희 과장</span> </p> <p style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; MARGIN: 0px; COLOR: #000000; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16px; COLOR: #000000; LINE-HEIGHT: 26px; FONT-FAMILY: